        "official_en_sha256": "2304d112a4780913f60cd0c12d266b4f550fea2dc95ac1744e2fc738d0e42061"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なるほど……。\r\n情報のないまま、ここに降り立つのは\r\nやめておきましょう。",
        "official_en": "...Very well. Until we learn more, we should refrain from landing here.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
